{UTF-8}
{ Chapter 7: a claims service centre. Cases arrive, wait in a backlog and are closed by trained staff; staff are hired through a training pipeline. First draft, before validation: completions are set by staff alone, and work pressure divides by capacity. }
Base Arrivals=
	500
	~	cases/week
	~	Cases arriving each week before the change.
	|
Arrival Change=
	0.2
	~	dmnl
	~	Fractional change in arrivals from week 10 (0.2 = 20% more; -1 = no arrivals).
	|
Case Arrivals=
	Base Arrivals * (1 + STEP(Arrival Change, 10))
	~	cases/week
	~	|
Backlog= INTEG(
	Case Arrivals - Completions,
	1000)
	~	cases
	~	Open cases waiting or in progress.
	|
Closed Cases= INTEG(
	Completions,
	0)
	~	cases
	~	Cumulative cases closed since week 0.
	|
Target Service Time=
	2
	~	week
	~	Time the centre aims to take to close a case.
	|
Desired Completions=
	Backlog / Target Service Time
	~	cases/week
	~	|
Standard Productivity=
	25
	~	cases/person/week
	~	Cases a trained person closes per week at normal pace.
	|
Standard Capacity=
	Staff * Standard Productivity
	~	cases/week
	~	|
Work Pressure=
	Desired Completions / Standard Capacity
	~	dmnl
	~	Desired completions relative to normal capacity.
	|
Pressure Sensitivity=
	0.5
	~	dmnl
	~	How strongly staff speed up (or slow down) under pressure; 0 switches the loop off.
	|
Productivity Effect=
	MIN(1.25, MAX(0.75, 1 + Pressure Sensitivity * (Work Pressure - 1)))
	~	dmnl
	~	Overtime and shortcuts: up to 25% faster under pressure, up to 25% slower when work is short.
	|
Capacity=
	Standard Capacity * Productivity Effect
	~	cases/week
	~	|
Completions=
	Capacity
	~	cases/week
	~	Set by staff capacity.
	|
Desired Staff=
	Desired Completions / Standard Productivity
	~	person
	~	|
Hiring Time=
	6
	~	week
	~	Time to decide, advertise and recruit.
	|
Average Tenure=
	100
	~	week
	~	|
Quits=
	Staff / Average Tenure
	~	person/week
	~	|
Hiring=
	MAX(0, (Desired Staff - Staff) / Hiring Time + Quits)
	~	person/week
	~	Replaces quits and closes the staff gap; ignores people already in training.
	|
Training Time=
	4
	~	week
	~	|
Trainees= INTEG(
	Hiring - Graduations,
	0.8)
	~	person
	~	|
Graduations=
	Trainees / Training Time
	~	person/week
	~	|
Staff= INTEG(
	Graduations - Quits,
	20)
	~	person
	~	Trained staff.
	|
INITIAL TIME = 0 ~ week ~ |
FINAL TIME = 60 ~ week ~ |
TIME STEP = 0.0625 ~ week ~ |
SAVEPER = 0.0625 ~ week ~ |
